'''Iron Flask''' is a [[utility flask]] base type.

Despite being named after "iron", an Iron Flask grants [[ward]]. Flasks that grant a temporary buff to armour are {{il|Basalt Flask}} and {{il|Granite Flask}}.

==Modifiers==
{{Main|List of modifiers for Iron Flask}}

Iron Flask has a slightly different pool of [[modifier]]s that it can roll compared to the standard pool of modifiers compatible with utility flasks.

Iron Flask can roll affixes that grant {{c|mod|X% increased Ward during Flask effect}}. These include the following:

{{Query spawnable affixes
|where = mods.domain=2
  AND mod_spawn_weights.tag="expedition_flask"
|generation_type = 1
|spawn_weights = 1
}}

Iron Flask ''cannot'' roll affixes that grant {{c|mod|X% increased Armour during Flask effect}} or {{c|mod|X% increased Evasion Rating during Flask effect}}.

